# Drive leaves numbered twins next to every file it touches ("pedir 2.js").
# An empty one inside api/ aborts the whole deploy: "A Serverless Function has
# an invalid name ... must not contain any space". The twins are not deleted by
# hand, because Drive puts them back, so they are ignored here instead.
* [0-9]*
